{"id":"0ebeb8d3fc2779d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-conformal.md","title":"Conformal Map","display":"df-conformal — Conformal Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-conformal","aliases":["58-df-conformal","Conformal Map"],"display":"df-conformal — Conformal Map","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-conformal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-conformal</span><span>Conformal Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conformal — Conformal Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e27b623be13cf38\" href=\"?note=2e27b623be13cf38\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md\">../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb C\\land z_0\\in U\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb C\\land z_0\\in U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^U\">\\(\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^U\\)</span> (holomorphic-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e27b623be13cf38\" href=\"?note=2e27b623be13cf38\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md\">../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conformal}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Conformal}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (conformal-at-a-point predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conformal}_S(f,U,z_0)\\leftrightarrow\nz_0\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\n\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in U\\;\n\\left(0&lt;|z-z_0|&lt;\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z)-f(z_0)}{z-z_0}-L\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conformal}_S(f,U,z_0)\\leftrightarrow\nz_0\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\n\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in U\\;\n\\left(0&lt;|z-z_0|&lt;\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z)-f(z_0)}{z-z_0}-L\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Conformal: angle-preserving at points where derivative is non-zero</li>\n<li>Holomorphic + <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(z_0) \\neq 0\">\\(f&#39;(z_0) \\neq 0\\)</span> implies conformal; converse requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;\">\\(f&#39;\\)</span> continuous</li>\n<li>Riemann mapping theorem: every simply connected proper open subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span> is biholomorphic to unit disk</li>\n<li>Aut(<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{D}\">\\(\\mathbb{D}\\)</span>) = M&quot;obius transformations preserving disk</li>\n<li>Schwarz lemma: self-maps of disk have derivative bounded by 1</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e27b623be13cf38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e27b623be13cf38","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^U$ (holomorphic-function predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb C\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb C\\land z_0\\in U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U\\subseteq\\mathbb C^U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conformal}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conformal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Conformal}_S(f,U,z_0)\\leftrightarrow\nz_0\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\n\\land\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall z\\in U\\;\n\\left(0<|z-z_0|<\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(z)-f(z_0)}{z-z_0}-L\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f'(z_0) \\neq 0","display":false},{"tex":"f'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{D}","display":false}],"bytes":1435,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-conformal.md|58-df-conformal]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["2e27b623be13cf38"]}